    "description": "Agent tool for the voice path. Marks one offered slot as read back (state CONFIRM, slotId on the session) so AR-13 BookingGate can book it in the next turn. Inputs: sessionId, slotId. Returns {ok, when, dealerName, say} or {ok:false, error}."
